title: What Power Do We Want
subtitle: The system of government PPS stands for.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/reichstag_3.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.stanceAvailable(Q, 'form_of_power') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.form_of_power (catalogue 4.4; technical reference 10.8): 1 T, 0 R, the card then waits 6 months. The present line is shown and cannot be
// chosen again; closing the card is free (Z — 0.32).
PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'form_of_power');
!}

= What Power Do We Want

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration costs this month's action; it changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @parliamentarism
- @strong_presidency
- @workers_councils
- @easy_discard

@parliamentarism
title: Parliamentarism
subtitle: The way of majorities, cabinet responsibility and democratisation.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'form_of_power', 'parliamentarism').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_parliamentarism_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'form_of_power', 'parliamentarism');
!}
go-to: result

@strong_presidency
title: A stronger presidency
subtitle: Only with this line PPS can prepare the reform of presidential arbitration; a later change keeps a prepared project.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'form_of_power', 'strong_presidency').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_strong_presidency_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'form_of_power', 'strong_presidency');
!}
go-to: result

@workers_councils
title: Workers’ councils
subtitle: The first time: Lewica +4 strength, Centrum dissent +3. No KPP votes, no workers’ representation and no voters by itself.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'form_of_power', 'workers_councils').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_workers_councils_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'form_of_power', 'workers_councils');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

